{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/928566e82d957e958b5386feb6df796e.avif?t=1773714003\" width=892 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell's Bells is a dark erotic visual novel steeped in ritual, devotion, and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by unknown whispers, you enter a long-forgotten chapel ruled by three Sisters who do not serve salvation. They offer something far more intimate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape devotion, dominance, surrender, and consequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every vow has a cost. Every ritual leaves a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you submit to revelation, or try to control what was never meant to be controlled?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARTAKE IN OCCULT RITUALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/4481c358a6f71bf20d3d97d68267670c.poster.avif?t=1773714003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/4481c358a6f71bf20d3d97d68267670c.webm?t=1773714003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/4481c358a6f71bf20d3d97d68267670c.mp4?t=1773714003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step beyond confession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform branching ritual paths tied to each Sister</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique scenes based on obedience, defiance, or devotion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock relics from rituals once completed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple endings shaped by your choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVOTION, DOMINANCE, AND POWER EXCHANGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/a918bb24f2e7998cfa860fa36e1dbb43.poster.avif?t=1773714003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/a918bb24f2e7998cfa860fa36e1dbb43.webm?t=1773714003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/a918bb24f2e7998cfa860fa36e1dbb43.mp4?t=1773714003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is about power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consentual domination and submission dynamics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong character driven dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritualistic intimacy and escalating tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player shaped relationships with each Sister</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CHAPEL THAT WATCHES YOU BACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/7639c2a2a0af0c13df2c31d91ebc55cd.poster.avif?t=1773714003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/7639c2a2a0af0c13df2c31d91ebc55cd.webm?t=1773714003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/7639c2a2a0af0c13df2c31d91ebc55cd.mp4?t=1773714003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chapel never forgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A persistent progression system across routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable relics and offerings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden dialogue and layered lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive scenes that acknowledge your actions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BELLES ARE CALLING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/extras/457244f8f8fb061c4926ab35c2b4208e.avif?t=1773714003\" width=892 height=596 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chapel doors did not open by accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make draws you deeper into a malevolent world of devotion, temptation, and revelation. The Sisters each offer a different path, but none lead you back unchanged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truth is earned through ritual. Power demands surrender. And some vows <i>cannot be taken back.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762900?t=1773714003","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/b7a5f89cabe8e419aece1d68d7251cae37940e26/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773714003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/8f62d2935e3ba5a9babc23f4782ccd5b464bb312/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773714003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762900/8f62d2935e3ba5a9babc23f4782ccd5b464bb312/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773714003","categories":[{"descript